FQN: Example: Extract Text Fragments from a Page
Kind: verified_example
Use `TextFragmentAbsorber` to enumerate all text fragments on the first page.

Example:
using Aspose.Pdf;
using Aspose.Pdf.Text;

var data = System.IO.File.ReadAllBytes("document.pdf");
using var doc = Document.Open(data);
var absorber = new TextFragmentAbsorber();
absorber.Visit(doc.Pages[1]);
foreach (var fragment in absorber.TextFragments)
{
    Console.WriteLine(fragment.Text);
}
Source-Commit: b7172877651413cff57a8bfe41fb8a8befb2406b

